@media (max-width:749px){.rs #compare .pk-cmp-scale .note{padding-left:8px;font-size:10px}.rs #compare .pk-cmp-scale figcaption{font-size:11.5px}.rs table.pk-cmp .go{padding:0 12px;font-size:13px}}
</style><div class="rs rs-body rs-one"><section class="pk-carry" id="carry"><div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Small enough to carry</p><h2>Fits in a tote. <em>Plays in the rain.</em></h2><p class="lede">Four inches across and easy to hold in one hand. Take it to the garden, the porch, the park or on a trip, and let the rain or the mallet do the rest.</p></div>
