<ul class="pk-places"><li><b>Garden</b><span>On the potting bench or a garden wall</span></li><li><b>Porch</b><span>On the rail, under the eaves</span></li><li><b>Park</b><span>In a tote with your picnic</span></li><li><b>Beach</b><span>Tucked in the beach bag</span></li><li><b>Camping</b><span>Light enough for the pack</span></li><li><b>Travel</b><span>Fits in a carry-on</span></li><li><b>Desk</b><span>A calm minute between calls</span></li><li><b>Their room</b><span>A grandchild’s bedroom shelf</span></li></ul></section>
<section class="box pk-box" id="box"><div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">What's in the box</p><h2>The drum, <em>and its mallet.</em></h2><p class="lede">Nothing to assemble and nothing extra to pack. Unwrap it and play.</p></div>
<div class="main"><div class="kf"><img src="{{ 'rain-drum-on-linen.png' | file_img_url: '1000x' }}" alt="The Pocket Drum on soft linen" width="1000" height="1000" loading="lazy"></div><div><span class="k">In the box</span><b>The Pocket Drum (M)</b><span>A 4-inch steel drum with 9 tuned notes, plus one mallet for dry days. Free tracked shipping on every order.</span></div></div>
<button type="button" class="atc" data-atc><span>Add to bag</span><span class="num" id="atcp2">{{ rs_unit | money }}</span></button></section><section class="guar" id="guarantee"><div class="gtop"><div class="seal" aria-hidden="true"><span class="s1">30-Day</span><b>Money-Back</b><span class="s2">Guarantee</span></div><div class="gcopy"><p class="eyebrow">Zero risk</p><h2>Love it, or <em>get your money back.</em></h2><p class="glead">If you’re not happy with your drum for any reason, return it within <b>30 days of delivery</b> for a <b>full refund of the item price</b>.</p></div></div><ol class="g3"><li><span class="n num">1</span><div><b>Email us</b><span>Send your order number to support@madespecial.store. We reply within 1–2 business days.</span></div></li><li><span class="n num">2</span><div><b>Send it back</b><span>Return it within 30 days of delivery using the instructions we email you.</span></div></li><li><span class="n num">3</span><div><b>Get your refund</b><span>Once it’s received, we refund your original payment method within 5–10 business days.</span></div></li></ol><p class="gdmg"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3l7.5 3v5.5c0 4.6-3.2 8.3-7.5 9.5-4.3-1.2-7.5-4.9-7.5-9.5V6L12 3z"/><path d="M8.6 12.2l2.4 2.4 4.6-4.8"/></svg><span><b>Arrived damaged or wrong?</b> Email a photo within 7 days and we’ll send a free replacement or a full refund. No need to send it back.</span></p><p class="gfine">Bundles can be returned in full or in part. <a href="/policies/refund-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the full return policy</a></p></section><section class="sec" id="rs-videos" style="padding-top:var(--s6)"><div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Heard in real gardens</p><h2>Rain, <em>on their porches.</em></h2></div><div class="ugc2"><figure class="vc"><img src="//madespecial.store/cdn/shop/files/preview_images/4dab23a822464f6191afd5f1e53bf421.thumbnail.0000000000_800x.jpg" alt="Video from Linda" loading="lazy" width="450" height="800"><button type="button" class="pb" aria-label="Play Linda’s video" data-src="//madespecial.store/cdn/shop/videos/c/vp/4dab23a822464f6191afd5f1e53bf421/4dab23a822464f6191afd5f1e53bf421.HD-1080p-7.2Mbps-98161603.mp4?v=0"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5.5v13l11-6.5-11-6.5z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></button><figcaption><q>Really nice drum, and it’s so fun to play. It sounds great!</q><span class="vn">Linda</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="vc"><img src="//madespecial.store/cdn/shop/files/preview_images/bb0b71989e544af5963f66c6a133953b.thumbnail.0000000000_800x.jpg" alt="Video from Mahinder" loading="lazy" width="450" height="800"><button type="button" class="pb" aria-label="Play Mahinder’s video" data-src="//madespecial.store/cdn/shop/videos/c/vp/bb0b71989e544af5963f66c6a133953b/bb0b71989e544af5963f66c6a133953b.HD-1080p-7.2Mbps-98161601.mp4?v=0"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5.5v13l11-6.5-11-6.5z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></button><figcaption><q>The quality is great… I’d definitely gift this to someone!</q><span class="vn">Mahinder</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="vc"><img src="//madespecial.store/cdn/shop/files/preview_images/5c3af8485a5b423ea4b0734fb4760915.thumbnail.0000000000_800x.jpg" alt="Video from Carolyn" loading="lazy" width="450" height="800"><button type="button" class="pb" aria-label="Play Carolyn’s video" data-src="//madespecial.store/cdn/shop/videos/c/vp/5c3af8485a5b423ea4b0734fb4760915/5c3af8485a5b423ea4b0734fb4760915.HD-1080p-7.2Mbps-98161602.mp4?v=0"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5.5v13l11-6.5-11-6.5z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></button><figcaption><q>I bought this as a gift and loved it so much that I got a smaller one for myself!</q><span class="vn">Carolyn</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="vc"><img src="//madespecial.store/cdn/shop/files/preview_images/dceaf104de1b4e48a5bf19658883556e.thumbnail.0000000000_800x.jpg" alt="Video from Mahayar" loading="lazy" width="450" height="800"><button type="button" class="pb" aria-label="Play Mahayar’s video" data-src="//madespecial.store/cdn/shop/videos/c/vp/dceaf104de1b4e48a5bf19658883556e/dceaf104de1b4e48a5bf19658883556e.HD-1080p-7.2Mbps-98161599.mp4?v=0"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5.5v13l11-6.5-11-6.5z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></button><figcaption><q>He sent me a video from his porch, sipping hot tea in the rain and enjoying the sound.</q><span class="vn">Mahayar</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="vc"><img src="//madespecial.store/cdn/shop/files/preview_images/273278acdb604bde9f71105b3ae16375.thumbnail.0000000000_800x.jpg" alt="Video from Pete" loading="lazy" width="450" height="800"><button type="button" class="pb" aria-label="Play Pete’s video" data-src="//madespecial.store/cdn/shop/videos/c/vp/273278acdb604bde9f71105b3ae16375/273278acdb604bde9f71105b3ae16375.HD-1080p-7.2Mbps-98161606.mp4?v=0"><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5.5v13l11-6.5-11-6.5z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></button><figcaption><q>It’s good quality and easy to use.</q><span class="vn">Pete</span></figcaption></figure></div><p class="ugcnote">Videos from Made Special customers · swipe for more · tap for sound</p></section><section class="gift2" id="gift"><p class="eyebrow">Make it a gift</p><h2>Who's it <em>for?</em></h2>
<div class="chips" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Who's it for?"><button type="button" class="chip on" role="radio" aria-checked="true" data-who="0">Grandkids</button><button type="button" class="chip" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-who="1">Mom</button><button type="button" class="chip" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-who="2">Grandma</button><button type="button" class="chip" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-who="3">A friend</button><button type="button" class="chip" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-who="4">Me</button></div>
<div class="whoimg" id="whoimg"><img class="on" src="{{ 'one-mallet-1.jpg' | file_img_url: '800x' }}" alt="A grandmother and a young child playing the Pocket Drum together with its mallet" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img class="" src="{{ 'cdbba897dafe5ed4c67f1ba2b12819ae_8257f841-3cb6-4704-b232-301ddb90781c.png' | file_img_url: '800x' }}" alt="The Pocket Drum on a table on a covered porch" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img class="" src="{{ 'f0b16637e777d627660977b2ad8a4c5a.png' | file_img_url: '800x' }}" alt="A grandmother in a garden chair listening to the Pocket Drum on a stone wall" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img class="" src="{{ 'bca4b04c499ef3388bf9b8600ea01689.png' | file_img_url: '800x' }}" alt="The Pocket Drum on a garden table under a tree" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img class="" src="{{ '1a4cabb5ea5b577d45b9c901063b70c4.png' | file_img_url: '800x' }}" alt="The Pocket Drum on a window ledge beside a teapot and mug" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
<div class="fl" id="fl" aria-live="polite"><p class="forline on">For the grandkids. Small enough for little hands, a bedroom shelf or a trip to Grandma’s.</p><p class="forline">For Mom’s porch. She can set it on the rail and let the rain play.</p><p class="forline">For Grandma’s garden. Nine notes in one scale: nothing to learn, nothing to tune.</p><p class="forline">For the friend who has everything. A stocking stuffer she won’t have seen before.</p><p class="forline">For you. A little rain concert by the window, or wherever you carry it.</p></div>
<div class="opt on" style="cursor:default"><span class="cb"><svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg></span><span class="t">Ship it straight to them<small>Add their address at checkout</small></span><span class="v">Free</span></div></section><section class="sound"><div class="sound-pic"><img src="{{ 'rain-drum-on-porch-railing.png' | file_img_url: '1000x' }}" width="1000" height="750" alt="The Pocket Drum on a porch railing in the rain" loading="lazy"><button type="button" class="listen" data-scroll="rs-videos"><span class="pb"><svg class="ic" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5.5v13l11-6.5-11-6.5z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span><span>Hear it in the rain<small>Customer videos</small></span></button></div><div class="in">
<p class="eyebrow">Listen</p><h2>Put the kettle on. <em>Let the weather play.</em></h2><p class="lede" style="margin:16px 0 0">Nine tuned notes in one scale, so every drop sounds like it belongs. Small drum, clear bell-like ring.</p></div></section><section class="sec"><div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Nothing to learn. <em>Nothing to tune.</em></h2></div>
<div class="steps"><div class="step"><span class="k num">01</span><div><h3>Set it outside</h3><p>On a table, a wall or the porch rail. Steady rain plays it.</p></div></div>
<div class="step"><span class="k num">02</span><div><h3>Or tap it with the mallet</h3><p>Every note is in one scale, so any order sounds good.</p></div></div>
<div class="step"><span class="k num">03</span><div><h3>Take it with you</h3><p>Wipe it dry and pack it for the next place you want a little music.</p></div></div></div></section>{%- assign p6 = all_products['steel-tongue-rain-drum'] -%}
<section class="sec" id="compare"><div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Which drum?</p><h2>The Pocket Drum, <em>or the Pro Drum?</em></h2></div>
<div class="pk-cmp-scale" aria-hidden="true"><span class="note">Drawn<br>to scale</span><figure><svg viewBox="0 0 58 58" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><circle cx="29" cy="29" r="27.5"/><circle cx="29" cy="29" r="6" opacity=".6"/></svg><figcaption><b>4 in</b>Pocket (M) · 9 notes</figcaption></figure><figure><svg viewBox="0 0 86 86" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><circle cx="43" cy="43" r="41.5"/><circle cx="43" cy="43" r="9" opacity=".6"/></svg><figcaption><b>6 in</b>Pro (L) · 11 notes</figcaption></figure></div>
