{%- when 'reviews' -%}<div class="rs rs-body rs-reviews"><section class="sec" id="rs-reviews"><div class="sec-head" style="margin-bottom:0"><p class="eyebrow">Reviews</p><h2>From people who've <em>heard it.</em></h2></div></section></div>
{%- when 'two' -%}<div class="rs rs-body rs-two"><section class="sec"><div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Before you <em>pack it.</em></h2></div><div class="acc" style="padding-top:0"><details open><summary>How big is it?<svg class="ic" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="body">About 4 inches across. It sits in the palm of your hand and slips into a handbag, tote or backpack.</div></details><details><summary>What comes in the box?<svg class="ic" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="body">The drum and one mallet. The Pocket Drum doesn’t come with extra accessories. If you’d like the guide book and extras, the Pro Drum (L) includes 6.</div></details><details><summary>Can I take it traveling?<svg class="ic" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="body">Yes. It’s small enough for a carry-on or beach bag. If it’s been out in the rain, wipe it dry before you pack it.</div></details><details><summary>How fast will it arrive?<svg class="ic" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="body">Each drum ships within 2–3 days with free tracking and insurance. Expect it at your door in 5–10 business days.</div></details><details><summary>Can I send it straight to them?<svg class="ic" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="body">Yes. Enter their address as the delivery address at checkout and we’ll ship it straight to them.</div></details><details><summary>I can’t read music. Will I manage?<svg class="ic" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="body">Yes. All nine notes are in one scale, so whatever you tap sounds good together.</div></details><details><summary>Can it live outside?<svg class="ic" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="body">It’s made to be played by the rain. Wipe it dry afterwards and bring it in for frost, snow and storms.</div></details><details><summary>Is it loud?<svg class="ic" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="body">No. It has a soft, bell-like tone you’ll hear on the patio without it carrying down the street.</div></details><details><summary>What if they don’t love it?<svg class="ic" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="body">Return it within 30 days of delivery for a full refund of the item price. Email support@madespecial.store with your order number to start.</div></details></div></section><section class="final"><img src="{{ 'rain-drum-on-wet-slate.png' | file_img_url: '1000x' }}" width="1000" height="750" alt="The Pocket Drum on wet slate after the rain" loading="lazy"><div class="in">
<p class="eyebrow" style="color:#D7B98A">This Christmas</p><h2>Rain music, <em>wherever you go.</em></h2><p>Save up to <span data-f="maxoff">30%</span> when you buy more than one. Free tracked shipping and 30 days to decide.</p>
<button type="button" class="atc" data-scroll="buy"><span>Pick Your Set</span><span class="num" data-f="from">From {{ rs_from | money }}</span></button></div></section>
<div class="sticky" id="sticky" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'rain-drum-on-moss.png' | file_img_url: '120x' }}" alt="" width="48" height="48"><div class="s"><b><span class="num" id="stp">{{ rs_unit | money }}</span> · <span id="stn">1 drum</span></b><span id="stk">Mallet included · free shipping</span></div><button type="button" data-atc>Add to bag</button></div></div>
{%- endcase -%}
{% stylesheet %}
/* t81u: upsell-preview radius system, rainsong page only */
  body:has(.rs-top) .blocky-featured-product:has(.rs-top) .rs-top .gal,
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs-top .gal,
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .gal{
    border-radius:18px !important;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .thumbs button{
    border-radius:11px;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .thumbs button img{border-radius:11px}
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .set,
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .set:first-of-type,
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .set:last-of-type,
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .set:nth-of-type(2){
    border-radius:18px;
    overflow:hidden;
    margin-top:0;
  }
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .set + .set{margin-top:10px}
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .set.on{border-radius:18px}
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .set .tag,
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .set .tag.v,
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .bfchip,
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .ph{border-radius:6px}
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .bon{
    border-radius:14px;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .main .kf{border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden}
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .atc,
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .sticky button,
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .final .atc,
  body:has(.rs-top) #buy,
  body:has(.rs-top) #buy button,
  body:has(.rs-top) [data-atc],
  body:has(.rs-top) [data-blocky-add-button],
  body:has(.rs-top) form.blocky-product-form [data-blocky-add-button],
  body:has(.rs-top) .blocky-product-form button[type="submit"],
  body:has(.rs-top) button[data-blocky-add-button]{
    border-radius:14px !important;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .sticky{
    border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .acc details{
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:14px;
    background:var(--card);
    padding:0 16px;
    margin:0 0 10px;
  }
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .gal .count,
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .slide figcaption{border-radius:6px}
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .eta2{border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden}
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .vc,
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .ugc2 .vc{border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden}
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .final{border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden}
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .guar{border-radius:18px}
  body:has(.rs-top) .jdgm-card,
  body:has(.rs-top) .jdgm-rev,
  body:has(.rs-top) .jdgm-carousel-item,
  body:has(.rs-top) .jdgm-widget .jdgm-all-reviews__header,
  body:has(.rs-top) [class*="jdgm"][class*="card"]{
    border-radius:14px;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs-jdgm-wrap{border-radius:14px}

  /* Main gift: replace still with looping muted video and enlarge the media */
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .main{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
    gap:14px;
    align-items:start;
    padding:12px;
  }
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .main .kf{
    position:relative;
    width:100%;
    height:auto;
    aspect-ratio:1 / 1;
    padding:0;
    border-radius:14px;
    overflow:hidden;
    background:#EBE2D3;
    display:block;
  }
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .main img,
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .main .kf img,
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .box .main img{
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    max-width:none;
    object-fit:cover;
    object-position:50% 50%;
    border-radius:0;
    display:block;
  }
  body:has(.rs-top) .rs .main .rs-main-video{
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    object-fit:cover;
    object-position:50% 50%;
    display:block;
    pointer-events:none;
    background:#EBE2D3;
  }
  @media (max-width:359px){
    body:has(.rs-top) .rs .main{
      grid-template-columns:1fr;
      gap:12px;
    }
    body:has(.rs-top) .rs .main .kf,
    body:has(.rs-top) .rs .main img{
      width:100%;
      height:auto;
    }
  }
  @media (min-width:750px){
    body:has(.rs-top) .rs .main{
      grid-template-columns:minmax(260px, 42%) minmax(0,1fr);
      gap:20px;
      align-items:center;
      padding:16px 20px 16px 16px;
    }
    body:has(.rs-top) .rs .main b{font-size:24px;line-height:1.2}
  }
  @media (min-width:990px){
    body:has(.rs-top) .rs .box .main{
      max-width:1080px;
      margin:0 auto;
      grid-template-columns:minmax(440px, 1.05fr) minmax(280px, 0.85fr);
      gap:28px;
      align-items:center;
      padding:20px 28px 20px 20px;
    }
    body:has(.rs-top) .rs .main b{font-size:32px;line-height:1.15;margin:6px 0}
    body:has(.rs-top) .rs .main span{font-size:17px;line-height:1.4}
    body:has(.rs-top) .rs .main .k{font-size:12px}
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
{% schema %}
{"name":"Pocket Drum page (4-inch)","tag":"section","class":"rs-section","settings":[
{"type":"select","id":"part","label":"Part","default":"one","options":[{"value":"one","label":"Carry, box, guarantee, gift, compare"},{"value":"reviews","label":"Reviews heading"},{"value":"two","label":"FAQ, final call to action"}]}],
"presets":[{"name":"Pocket Drum page (4-inch)"}]}
{% endschema %}
